  <element>
    <id>Text</id>
    <coordinates><x>0</x><y>0</y><w>1500</w><h>30</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Microservice architecture: four bounded contexts, one Spring Boot service each, integrated over Apache Kafka (spec-01 s1.2 to s1.5). Solid arrows: down = publishes to a topic, up = consumes; dashed = synchronous REST or HTTPS</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates><x>20</x><y>70</y><w>180</w><h>150</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;client&gt;&gt;
pos-simulator
--
JDK-only command line
that drives the demo:
seeds batches, then
POST /api/transactions
to sales-service over
REST at a chosen rate
bg=#FFFFFF
halign=left</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates><x>1320</x><y>70</y><w>170</w><h>150</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;external system&gt;&gt;
Google Gemini API
--
HTTPS from insight-
service only, through
LangChain4j (R2); key
and model name from
the environment
(ADR 0004)
bg=#FFFFFF
halign=left</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates><x>230</x><y>70</y><w>250</w><h>280</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>sales-service  :8082
Sales context
--
pattern: Transaction Script
TransactionApplicationService
PriceSnapshot (local, event-fed)
H2: salesdb

REST: POST /api/transactions

publishes: item-sold
consumes: price-rule-published,
  markdown-applied
bg=#E2F0D9
halign=left</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates><x>500</x><y>70</y><w>250</w><h>280</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>inventory-service  :8081
Inventory &amp; Batch context
--
pattern: Domain Model
StockBatch &lt;&lt;AR&gt;&gt;,
FefoDeductionPolicy
H2: inventorydb

REST: POST /api/batches,
  GET /api/batches/{id}, ?sku=

publishes: batch-received,
  stock-level-changed
consumes: item-sold
bg=#DDEBF7
halign=left</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates><x>770</x><y>70</y><w>250</w><h>280</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>pricing-service  :8083
Pricing &amp; Markdown context
--
pattern: Domain Model
MarkdownPlan &lt;&lt;AR&gt;&gt;, PriceRule,
MarginFloorPolicy (FR11 invariant)
H2: pricingdb

REST: PUT/GET /api/prices/{sku},
  POST/GET /api/markdown-plans

publishes: price-rule-published,
  markdown-applied
consumes:
  markdown-recommended
bg=#FCE5CD
halign=left</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates><x>1040</x><y>70</y><w>250</w><h>280</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>insight-service  :8084
Insight context
--
pattern: CQRS read side +
  domain package (ADR 0006)
Kafka Streams: velocity (FR12),
  batch state, risk (FR13)
Markdown Decision Agent (FR14)
Briefing Agent (FR15)
H2: insightdb (traces, briefings)

REST: GET /api/insight/
  velocity/{sku}, /risks,
  /agent-traces/{id};
  POST/GET /api/insight/briefings
bg=#FFF2CC
halign=left</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLClass</id>
    <coordinates><x>230</x><y>470</y><w>1060</w><h>110</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Apache Kafka 3.9 (KRaft, one broker)  +  Spring Cloud Stream Kafka binder
--
integration topics (contracts module, Published Language): batch-received, stock-level-changed, item-sold, price-rule-published, sell-through-risk-
detected, markdown-recommended, markdown-applied
internal topic (insight-service only): velocity-baseline-published
every event carries eventId (UUID, idempotent consumption) and occurredAt (producer event time)
bg=#F2F2F2
halign=left</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
